      "description": "Boise State University Skip to main content Boise State University Home Search Menu Boise Global Navigation Apply Visit Give Menu Ready to take the next step? Plan your virtual visit. Search Search Your next chapter starts here Find your major, your people and your place at Boise State. Become a Bronco YOUR BEST COMES OUT OF THE BLUE At Boise State University, bold thinking meets hands-on learning, creative research and real-world partnerships to prepare graduates to lead, innovate and make an impact in Idaho and beyond. Find your major Major Finder Find your major Major Finder myBoiseState myBoiseState login myBoiseState myBoiseState login Cost and aid Cost and aid Cost and aid About Boise State About Boise State About Boise State Fast Facts Sources for featured statistics At Boise State, you’ll find affordable tuition, small class sizes and 200+ career-focused programs designed to set you up for success. 28K+ Enrolled students 200+ Majors 29 Average undergraduate class size 1 World famous Blue Turf $196 mil in financial aid for 14,534 students in the 2023-2024 academic year 45% of Boise State students graduate without incurring ANY student loan debt 200+ Student clubs and organizations 63K Alumni have chosen to live in the Treasure Valley after graduation Campus news Read all campus news New flagship commercial celebrates campus life, research and community September 02, 2026 New flagship commercial celebrates campus life, research and community Boise State University has launched its new institutional commercial, bringing the vibrant energy, innovation and… $8 million grant sparks ‘XTREME’ project to position Idaho as leader in resilient microelectronics August 31, 2026 $8 million grant sparks ‘XTREME’ project to position Idaho as leader in resilient microelectronics Northwest Commission on Colleges and Universities reaffirms Boise State’s accreditation August 25, 2026 Northwest Commission on Colleges and Universities reaffirms Boise State’s accreditation Studying ‘car-swallowing’ debris flows to improve hazard assessment in Idaho August 05, 2026 Studying ‘car-swallowing’ debris flows to improve hazard assessment in Idaho American Ninja Warrior features Boise State alum July 21, 2026 American Ninja Warrior features Boise State alum Read all campus news Boise State University (208) 426-1000 1910 University Drive, Boise, Idaho 83725 Follow Us Follow us on X Follow us on Facebook Follow us on Instagram Follow us on Youtube Follow us on Linkedin Secondary Navigation myBoiseState Safety, Security and Support Career Opportunities Boise State Public Radio Albertsons Library Transportation and Parking Partner with Us Morrison Center Alumni Bronco Shop and Bookstore University Administration ExtraMile Arena Broncos Logo Athletics Follow us on Facebook Follow us on Instagram Follow us on X Follow us on Youtube Follow us on LinkedIn Terms of Use Accessibility Privacy Classroom Concerns Policies Contact Boise State © 2026 All Rights Reserved\n\t\t\t\t\t\t Boise State University."
